                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4840070-763b-33d8-a03a-a249caea2b97",
                        "entry_id": "64e89314-f900-33d2-b5fd-b669f5cd9a51",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The Russian-language websites on the Internet, taken as a whole, Runet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "474b7fff-fb09-417a-9749-bf1d2384fbec",
                                "sense_id": "c4840070-763b-33d8-a03a-a249caea2b97",
                                "text": "Госду́ма приняла́ в пе́рвом чте́нии законопрое́кт «О сувере́нном интерне́те», кото́рый позво́лит изоли́ровать руне́т от глоба́льной се́ти.",
                                "translation": "The State Duma adopted in its first reading the draft law \"On the sovereign Internet\", which will allow to isolate the Russian web from the global network.",
                                "english": "The State Duma adopted in its first reading the draft law \"On the sovereign Internet\", which will allow to isolate the Russian web from the global network."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b309cbfd-f81b-4410-bcc1-e2ba96d2ab57",
                                "sense_id": "c4840070-763b-33d8-a03a-a249caea2b97",
                                "text": "– Послу́шай, они́ заби́ли свои́м спа́мом весь Руне́т, все уже́ зна́ют э́ту прекра́сную исто́рию.[...]",
                                "translation": "“Listen, they’ve flooded the Russian internet with their spam, everybody already knows this wonderful story.…”",
                                "english": "“Listen, they’ve flooded the Russian internet with their spam, everybody already knows this wonderful story.…”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
